uest":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124024","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124024","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124024.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124024.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nRelated to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123958\r\nMakes \"Replace All\" in Find in Files a bit faster.\r\n\r\nTested with the project from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123931#pullrequestreview-5345378629\r\n\r\nBefore: ~344216ms\r\nAfter: ~458ms\r\nImprovement: ~75156,33%\r\n(I ran only one test, so there might be a margin of error)\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAchieved by:\r\n- Not updating the file in EditorFileSystem with every change\r\n- Not updating matches text after every replaced item\r\n\r\nThe caveat is that filesystem scan happens after replacing is finished, but it's much faster than doing it for each file during replacing. I also removed script reloading, because it happens anyway with the scan.\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124024/reactions","total_count":22,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":8,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":12,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124024/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}